cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite this repository and also cite the original data study."
title: "MicroCTure: Deep Learning for Micro-C Contact Matrix Analysis"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "ppee"
repository-code: "https://github.com/PPEE523/MicroCTure"
url: "https://github.com/PPEE523/MicroCTure"
license: MIT
abstract: "A six-task pipeline for target-aware structure classification, unannotated pattern retrieval, genome-wide multi-condition visualization, contact-change analysis, synthetic super-resolution, and relative 3D contact embedding, with spatial controls and traceable results. No novel biological structure type is confirmed."
keywords:
  - Micro-C
  - chromatin
  - reproducibility
  - deep learning
  - Escherichia coli
